{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411230","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411230","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1241123001:1":{"text":"I'm wondering, why are you examining those two leaves so closely? Are you trying to find differences?","source_cn":"我说，你干嘛拿着两片叶子来回看？在找不同？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5591F9CD57F3E166","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241123002:1":{"text":"Take a look!","source_cn":"请看！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x477C0AB74D2C79A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241123003:1":{"text":"The leaf on the left is from a Glimmerbloom that I found in bushes nearby.","source_cn":"左边这一片是我从附近的草丛里捡到的，是荧荧花的叶子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1CEEEC00F9482B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241123004:1":{"text":"The other leaf is one I found earlier in the Dark Forest to use as a bookmark. It's also from a Glimmerbloom.","source_cn":"至于另外这片嘛，是我之前在薄暮丛林里捡到用来做书签的。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA05EA31EA36E38DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241123005:1":{"text":"As far as I know, only the Glimmerblooms on this island can speak, so I want to compare them to try to find out why the ones here are so unique!","source_cn":"只有这座岛上的荧荧花会说话，我想进行对比，看看它们有没...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F86ECC0825D94B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1241123005":{"text":"As far as I know, only the Glimmerblooms on this island can speak, so I want to compare them to try to find out why the ones here are so unique!","source_cn":"只有这座岛上的荧荧花会说话，我想进行对比，看看它们有没有形态上的差异，找出这里的荧荧花会说话的原因！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F86ECC0825D94B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241123006:1":{"text":"Absolutely nothing.","source_cn":"完全没有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA0DBAB29BA88277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241123007:1":{"text":"The vein patterns are exactly the same, and the leaf splits and colors are almost identical.","source_cn":"叶脉的走向完全一样，叶裂和颜色也几乎一致。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAED1FF31825953C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241123008:1":{"text":"But how is that possible? We're on an isolated island where the soil's salt content and water levels are vastly different from those in the Dark Forest!","source_cn":"但是，这怎么可能呢？我们在一座与世隔绝的海岛上，这里土...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x404387C211DCEE48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1241123009:1":{"text":"The Glimmerblooms here should have naturally evolved into a subspecies adapted to the island's climate!","source_cn":"这里的荧荧花，应该自然分化出适应海岛气候的亚种才对！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C7E6E4F8E10A2CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1241123010:1":{"text":"<male>Brother</male>, what is Hammie mumbling about?","source_cn":"<male>兄弟</male><female>妹子</...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x74D239914E8E21C1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"<male>Brother</male>, what is Hammie mumbling about?","female":"<female>Sister</female>, what is Hammie mumbling about?","variant_male_record_index":"137645","variant_female_record_index":"137646","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1241123010":{"text":"<male>Brother</male>, what is Hammie mumbling about?","source_cn":"<male>兄弟</male><female>妹子</female>，漫漫这嘀嘀咕咕地说什么呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x74D239914E8E21C1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"<male>Brother</male>, what is Hammie mumbling about?","female":"<female>Sister</female>, what is Hammie mumbling about?","variant_male_record_index":"137645","variant_female_record_index":"137646","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241123011:1":{"text":"\"Basic\" and \"research\"? To be honest, those two words don't fit well together!","source_cn":"“简单的”“研究”？要我说，这俩词根本不应该放在一起！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D3C0379A165145F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241123014:1":{"text":"…Is it possible that the island's strange magic is what taught the Glimmerblooms human language? What could be the reason?","source_cn":"……难道说，是这座海岛上覆盖着奇特的魔法，才让荧荧花学...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50F7C7FF0A5AE42D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241123015:1":{"text":"Absolutely, it's innate!","source_cn":"是，天生的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE562834D0D489534","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241123016:1":{"text":"However, there should be Misarte's magic in the Dark Forest as well, so why didn't the Glimmerblooms there develop this ability...?","source_cn":"但是，薄暮丛林里应该也有弥萨忒留下的魔力，为什么那里的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A9FAC150A35EFCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1241123017:1":{"text":"Mis...arte?","source_cn":"弥……萨忒？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB71BF560DA63B427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241123018:1":{"text":"Misarte is the goddess wo